{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1098574-anzu-messengers-of-the-gods","id":1098574,"title":"Anzu - Messengers of the Gods","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-05-30T15:01:51-07:00","id":1098574,"title":"Anzu - Messengers of the Gods","content":"So in another thread I was reading about someone who wanted to talk more shifters in the next edition. I liked some of the ideas but one has stuck with me for awhile, then i saw someone ask a question about what if the shifters wanted to reach out to Gaia. That got me thinking, what if the Garou really need to get a message to a spirit or needed to see one desperately. That got me thinking about extending the avian breed outside of just the Raven and extending what they do now just a little further.<br /> <br /> I started drawing up some basic templates for how I would I would do it and just wanted to share and see if there was any interest in the concept. Not only are they messengers among the changing breeds but they are also messengers and guides for those who need to find or get a message to particular spirit. Still rough, but if anyone likes the idea I will extend on it. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> New Trait: Flight - How the Anzu define themselves.<br /> <br /> Garuda<br /> Heralds of the Rising Sun<br /> -Eagles, Falcons, etc (Diurnal Birds of Prey)<br /> -Associated with the High Sky &amp; messengers of High Umbra<br /> -Warriors and Leaders<br /> <br /> Tengu<br /> Minders of the Cresting Sun<br /> -Crows/Ravens (Scavanging birds - Could include Vultures and Condors(?))<br /> -Associated with the Low Sky/Populated Areas &amp; messengers of Middle Umbra<br /> -Tricksters and Storytellers<br /> -Replace Corax<br /> <br /> Strix<br /> Ushers of the Twilight Sun<br /> -Owls (Nocturnal Birds of Prey)<br /> -Associated with Dark/Wild Areas &amp; messengers of Low Umbra<br /> -Mystics and Spies<br /> -Replace Camazots<br /> <br /> The current gift spread would break up appropriate Corax and Camazotz gifts and some new gifts would have to be introduced to round out each of the Flights pools.<br /> <br /> Plot points for Camazotz:<br /> -They never existed<br /> -They existed but their purpose was lost to history like so many other shifters<br /> -They are the only true shifter breed to fall entirely to the the wyrm","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1619-derzhuzad","name":"Derzhuzad","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1619_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"652"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}